Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.93,0:02:26.58,JOJO5-op1-jp-2,,0,0,0,fx,Дикано
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.93,0:02:26.58,JOJO5-op1-jp-2,,0,0,0,fx,Close-up
